{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ32o9LmZKUjWZV8ggS1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Not found with these tools.** I couldn't get Shift4's vendor concentration figure, such as the share of purchases or inventory from one vendor, for December 31, 2024.\n\n**What I did find:**\n- **The disclosure is in the FY2024 10-K.** Shift4's 10-K for the year ended Dec 31, 2024 contains the exact phrase \"one vendor\". It also matches searches for \"concentration\" plus \"vendor\", and for terms like \"third-party vendors\" or \"limited number of vendors\". So the 10-K seems to discuss reliance on one vendor, probably in the concentration-of-risk note or the risk factors.\n- **It doesn't use the term \"vendor concentration\".** That exact phrase returns nothing, and neither does \"single vendor\".\n- **No tagged percentage is available.** Shift4's XBRL data has no `ConcentrationRiskPercentage1` fact (the request returned a 404), so there's no machine-readable percentage to pull.\n\n**What's missing:** The search tool only tells me which filing matches. It doesn't return the matching text, and I had no way to open the document itself. So I can't tell you who the vendor is, what it supplies, or how large the concentration is. To get the details, check the \"Concentration of Risk\" note in the notes to the financial statements and the supplier and third-party dependency risk factors in the 10-K linked below.\n\n**Sources**\n- Shift4 Payments, Inc. Form 10-K for FY ended 2024-12-31, filed 2025-02-19, accession 0001794669-25-000011 (https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1794669/000179466925000011/four-20241231.htm)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":8850,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"959646e2-7170-48b8-8d4f-703f0546f815","uuid":"a382bd91-7b95-4d95-bd2b-6186445d7cbb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:10:17.419Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ32nuSyfi1Si71hS1Xf"}
